    "correct": "B",
    "rationale": "For acute severe hypertension in preeclampsia (SBP \u2265160 or DBP \u2265110), appropriate antihypertensives include IV hydralazine, IV labetalol, and oral nifedipine; ACE inhibitors and ARBs (like lisinopril and losartan) are contraindicated in pregnancy due to fetal renal toxicity.",
