    "stem": "A researcher is studying the molecular structure of the Hepatitis viruses. They note that one of the viruses, Hepatitis D (HDV), is completely defective and cannot cause infection on its own. It absolutely requires a specific protein produced by the Hepatitis B virus (HBV) to complete its own viral assembly and become infectious. Which specific HBV protein does Hepatitis D require?",
