    "stem": "A 22-year-old woman presents to the clinic with mucopurulent cervical discharge. A NAAT test is positive for *Neisseria gonorrhoeae*. Her NAAT for *Chlamydia* is pending, but you must treat her empirically today. According to current CDC guidelines, which of the following is the most appropriate treatment regimen?",
