    "stem": "A 14-year-old girl is receiving her second dose of the 9-valent Human Papillomavirus (HPV) vaccine. The vaccine is highly effective at preventing cervical cancer, vulvar cancer, and genital warts. Which of the following best describes the composition of the antigen used in this vaccine?",
