      "B": "No screening is indicated; she should return for her first Pap smear at age 25",
      "C": "Perform a Pap smear (cytology) today",
      "D": "Perform HPV DNA testing only today",
      "E": "Perform Co-testing (Pap smear + HPV DNA testing) today"
