    "yield_level": "Low",
    "stem": "A 62-year-old woman with severe menopausal hot flashes requests Hormone Replacement Therapy (HRT) from her physician. She underwent a total abdominal hysterectomy and bilateral salpingo-oophorectomy 5 years ago for massive, painful fibroids. Which of the following is the most appropriate HRT regimen for this specific patient?",
