    "yield_level": "High",
    "stem": "A 45-year-old multiparous woman presents with progressively heavier and more painful menstrual periods (menorrhagia and dysmenorrhea) over the past year. She describes her uterus as feeling \"heavy and full.\" Pelvic examination reveals a uniformly enlarged, soft, globular, and tender uterus. A pregnancy test is negative. Which of the following is the most likely diagnosis?",
