    "stem": "A 50-year-old woman is discussing contraception with her gynecologist. She has a BMI of 31 kg/m$^2$ and a strong family history of endometrial cancer. She asks if there are any contraceptive methods that actually decrease the risk of developing endometrial cancer. The physician correctly informs her that which of the following interventions provides the strongest protective effect against endometrial cancer?",
