    "yield_level": "High",
    "stem": "A histology image of an ovarian follicle shows a fluid-filled antral cavity, an oocyte surrounded by granulosa cells anchored to the lateral follicular wall by the cumulus oophorus, with a single layer of granulosa cells immediately adjacent to the zona pellucida. What is the name of this innermost layer that sperm must penetrate?",
