    "stem": "A placental biopsy shows finger-like projections containing fetal blood vessels and mesenchymal connective tissue, surrounded by two outer cell layers: an outer, darker layer with indistinct cell borders, and an inner layer of larger cuboidal cells. What are these fetal structures called, and what is the function of the outer layer?",
