    "stem": "A 16-year-old girl presents with recurrent first-trimester pregnancy loss risk factors identified on imaging: a single uterine cavity divided by a fibrous septum extending partway into the cavity, with a single cervix and normal external uterine contour. Which anomaly is this, and what is its embryologic basis?",
