    "stem": "A 14-year-old girl with normal secondary sexual characteristics presents with cyclic pelvic pain and a normal external genital exam, but is unable to insert a tampon. On exam, a bulging, bluish, waterballoon-like membrane is visualized at the introitus. Blood is presumed to be trapped behind this membrane. What is the diagnosis?",
