    "stem": "A 16-year-old girl presents with primary amenorrhea. She has a 46,XY karyotype, streak/hypoplastic gonads, and typical female internal organs including a uterus, fallopian tubes, and upper vagina. Genetic testing reveals a mutation in the SRY gene. Which condition does she have?",
