    "stem": "A newborn with ambiguous genitalia is later found to have a 46,XY karyotype with an autosomal recessive mutation in the gene encoding 5-alpha reductase. The infant is raised as a girl, but at puberty develops increased muscle mass, a deepened voice, and increased libido as testosterone levels rise. What is the underlying enzymatic defect?",
